  `~/.cache/uv/archive-v0/iUJXGFAmYOZiEWSq0JtEg/.../envs/kaggriculture/kaggriculture.py`
  has that hash. The project lock (kaggle-environments 1.29.0, no Kaggriculture
  environment) is unchanged.

