     8	//! Replay parity against Kaggle's Python engine (`kaggle-environments==1.32.7`).
     9	//!
    10	//! One comparator serves three trace sources: the four recorded official episodes,
    11	//! the committed traces that `scripts/kaggriculture_parity/generate_traces.py`
    12	//! produced by running Kaggle's engine live, and an optional sweep directory named
    13	//! by `KAGG_PARITY_TRACES`. Generated traces may also contain `rejected` records:
    14	//! Python's interpreter raised on those actions, so Kaggle kept the old state, and
    15	//! Rust must return an error without mutating its state.
    16	
    17	use kaggriculture_engine::{ATTRIB_FIELDS, Config, ECON_FIELDS, ECON_PASS, Game, TraceHeader};
    18	use serde_json::{Value, json};
    19	use std::fmt;
    20	use std::path::{Path, PathBuf};
